  "description": "Seo Cheongjin, a genius potter in the 21st century, possesses the body of a girl named Lee Yeong-Hwa in the Joseon Dynasty 500 years ago. Huh?! The ImJin War* is happening soon?! In order to go back to the present, Lee Yeong-Hwa will need to use her knowledge of history and make connections in order to survive. But why are historical figures coming closer and closer the further Yeong-Hwa is deviating from history?! \n\n*Japanese Invasion (1592)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60241863), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13176453), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4116004963), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000073671) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/124527)",
